#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/gemm_op/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"Same semantics as the common :func:`tilelang.language.gemm_op.gemm`: the "
"default synchronous GEMM. On Hopper, if the compiler selects WGMMA lowering, "
"TileLang inserts the corresponding wait implicitly. On Blackwell TCGEN5MMA, "
"TileLang inserts the corresponding ``mbarrier_wait_parity(...)`` implicitly "
"after issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/gemm_op/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"For manual asynchronous scheduling, use ``T.wgmma_gemm(...)`` with ``T."
"wait_wgmma(...)`` on Hopper, or ``T.tcgen05_gemm(...)`` with ``T."
"mbarrier_wait_parity(...)`` on Blackwell."
msgstr ""

